   &lt;div style=&#34;text-align: center;&#34; class=&#34;toggle-light&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://agentregistry.dev/img/ar-local-dark.png&#34; width=&#34;800px&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;/&gt; &lt;figcaption style=&#34;font-style:italic&#34;&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;next-steps&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;#next-steps&#34; class=&#34;subheading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink for this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;With agentregistry up and running, you can explore how to build, publish, and deploy AI artifacts:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://agentregistry.dev/docs/agents/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Build, run, and publish Docker images for agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://agentregistry.dev/docs/mcp/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MCP servers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Create and run MCP tool servers, add tools, and publish them as Docker images.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://agentregistry.dev/docs/skills/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Build and publish skills that you can add to your agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://agentregistry.dev/docs/prompts/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prompts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: Build and publish prompts that you can add to your agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

